  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You have learned how to infuse mythic power into small and subtle magics.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Ability to cast cantrips or orisons</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You learn the mythic versions of any cantrips and/or orisons that you know. In addition, you may select one additional mythic spell to learn for each mythic tier after 1st; however, the level of this spell cannot exceed one-half your mythic tier. You must know and be able to cast the non-mythic version of a spell to learn its mythic version.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-g-m-feats#toc98\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
